tags: all-addresses, *, internet

A kind of network: all the addresses that the node can reach. The instance can connect
to any IP address and any port. The node gives no list of members.

The value is empty. Any other value is not valid.

A node that does not let instances reach all addresses refuses the service. The node
is bound.

